 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Let's get them. Tent steaks are great, but they only last so long. Then look for sticks that feel like they'd be nice to lean on. A thick branch that's still got all its bark is perfect. Sticks that are deep underground won't, of course. Sticks that are shallow might tip over. It' a bit of a fine line. She'll get used to it. Sticks that feel nice to lean on are worth the space they take up. Then maybe show her how nice it is to sit on one after dark. Lots of people change their minds then.",
